t-weight: bold;\">)&nbsp; &nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;\">&nbsp; - (</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;\">학생</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;\">외국어 성적 입력 및 성적표 제출</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;\">업로드</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;\">기간 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;\">: </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;\">2020. 12. 31.(</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;\">목</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;\">)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;\">까지 *기한엄수*</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 85, 255); font-size: 11pt;\"> &nbsp; ※ </span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 85, 255); font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold;\">우리대학&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold;\">‘</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold;\">원스톱서비스</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold;\">’</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 85, 255); font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold;\">시스템에 입력 및 제출되어야 함</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 85, 255); font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp; ※</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;공인외국어시험 및 국제교류교육원에서 실시하는 모의토익(모의토익스피킹 포함) 모두 인정</span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 85, 255); font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: 700;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; ※</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: 700;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -31.46px; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">국제교류교육원에서 실시하는 모의토익</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -31.46px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">(</span><span style=\"text-indent: -31.46px; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">모의토익스피킹 포함</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -31.46px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"text-indent: -31.46px; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">성적은 국제교류교육원</span><span style=\"text-indent: -31.46px; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">에서 일괄 등록하므로 학생이 별도로 입력 및 제출하지 않아도 됨</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -31.46px; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 85, 255); font-size: 11pt;\"> &nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 85, 255); text-indent: -31.46px; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">하지만</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); text-indent: -31.46px; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 85, 255); font-size: 11pt;\">,</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 85, 255); font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 85, 255); text-indent: -31.46px; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold;\">본인의</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 85, 255); text-indent: -31.46px; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 85, 255); text-indent: -31.46px; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold;\">성적이 우리대학</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 85, 255); text-indent: -31.46px; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold;\">‘</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 85, 255); text-indent: -31.46px; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold;\">원스톱서비스</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 85, 255); text-indent: -31.46px; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold;\">’</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); text-indent: -31.46px; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 85, 255); font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">시스템에 제대로 입력되어 있는지 </span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 11pt;\">\"기한 내에\"&nbsp; \"학생본인이\"</span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); text-indent: -31.46px; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold;\">“</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); text-indent: -31.46px; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold;\">반드시</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); text-indent: -31.46px; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold;\">”</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 85, 255); text-indent: -31.46px; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 85, 255); text-indent: -31.46px; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold;\">확인하여야 함</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 85, 255); text-indent: -31.46px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;(모의토익 성적이 제대로 반영되어 있지 않거나, 모의토익 문의는 국제교류교육원 478-7215, 어학상담실 478-7959로 문의)</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 85, 255); text-indent: -31.46px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-size: 11pt; font-weight: 700;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; ※</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-size: 11pt; font-weight: 700;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-indent: -15.3pt; font-size: 11pt;\">교내 성적장학생</span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-indent: -15.3pt; font-size: 11pt;\">은 외국어성적을 취득하여야 함.</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-indent: -15.3pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); text-indent: -15.3pt; font-size: 11pt;\">외국어시험성적</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); text-indent: -15.3pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">(</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); text-indent: -15.3pt; font-size: 11pt;\">토익기준</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); text-indent: -15.3pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); text-indent: -15.3pt; font-size: 11pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">을</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-indent: -15.3pt; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, AppleSDGothicNeo, Dotum, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">제출하지 않을 경우 성적장학생 선발에서 제외.</span></span></span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 85, 255); text-indent: -31.46px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-indent: -15.3pt; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, AppleSDGothicNeo, Dotum, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, arial, sans-serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;외국어시험성적은 장학선발의 기본자격이며, 자격충족자 중 우수자 선발</span></span><br></span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 85, 255); text-indent: -31.46px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); text-indent: -31.46px; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: 700;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; ※</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); text-indent: -31.46px; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: 700;\">&nbsp;등록학기 기준으로 기준이 적용되오니 착오없으시기 바람&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -31.46px; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 9pt;\">ex) 1-2학기 성적으로 2-1학기 등록시 장학생으로 선정되기 위해서는 2학년 외국어성적기준을 충족해야 함</span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-indent: -15.3pt; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, AppleSDGothicNeo, Dotum, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, arial, sans-serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;\">&nbsp; - </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;\">학부</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;\">과</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;\">승인완료 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;\">: 2021. 1. 12.(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;\">화</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><b>까지&nbsp;</b><span style=\"font-size: 9pt;\"> * 학과 연락처 : 붙임참고</span></span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"> </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">▷ </span><strong><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">제출 방법 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">:  </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">붙임 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">‘</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">외국어성적 입력 방법</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">’ </span></strong><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>참고 &nbsp;</strong><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">* 공인외국어시험점수환산표수정(NewTEPS반영)</span></strong></span></p><p class=\"0\"><br></p><p class=\"0\">붙임&nbsp; 1.&nbsp;2021-1 교내 성적장학생 선발관련 외국어성적표 제출 안내</p><p class=\"0\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 2.&nbsp;&nbsp;외국어성적입력방법</p><p class=\"0\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 3.&nbsp;&nbsp;공인외국어시험 점수 환산표&nbsp;</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
